# Addition with FD improvement: [+ 1 2.0] infers result type Float
# Verifies that the builtin Add class FD (src determines result) fires correctly.
# The Add class has FD: [[a b] c] meaning (a, b) jointly determine c.
# When a=Int and b=Float, FD should improve c to Float.
[
  # Mixed-type addition: Int + Float
  # FD should improve result type to Float
  result: [+ 1 2.0]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Float(3.0)
